<title>PHILIPPINES: House of Investments to sell farms to Dole.</title>
<headline>House of Investments to sell farms to Dole.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>House of Investments Inc said on Tuesday its board had given approval for the sale of its banana farms in the Philippines to Dole Asia Ltd at a base price of $16.5 million.</p>
<p>&quot;The company was authorised...to enter into a stock sale and purchase agreement with Dole Asia Ltd on the sale of the banana farms for a base price of $16.5 million subject to the terms and conditions thereof,&quot; the company told the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Dole Asia is a unit of U.S. firm Dole Food Co Inc.</p>
<p>The company's disclosure to the stock exchange did not give further details.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
